# Frontend-only scope

This project is **Antigravity**. Default work is the Next.js web app only.

- **Do work in:** `antigravity/apps/web/` (pages, components, types, `lib/mock-data.ts`, `lib/api-client.ts`, styles)
- **Do not** change FastAPI, Python services, DB, brokers, scrapers, or infra unless the user explicitly asks
- Keep `USE_MOCK_DATA` as the frontend data source until the user asks to wire a live API
- Match the existing dark design system in `globals.css` (no white backgrounds)
- New UI should use mock data + `apiClient` so pages render without a backend
